  "content": "<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/maestro-music\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-70246b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/maestro-music\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-70246b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/maestro-music\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo_Forge-70246b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=702424\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Maestro 是一個以數據驅動的音樂編排框架，它擴展了 Minecraft 的音樂系統，透過資源包實現反應式、無縫銜接的遊戲配樂。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n## 反應式音樂編排\nMaestro 持續評估當前的遊戲情境，並即時選擇最合適的音樂定義。生態域、結構、實體、頭目遭遇戰、天氣、畫面狀態以及自訂事件，都能影響播放的曲目以及曲目之間的轉換方式。\n\n## 原版音樂，反應式升級\nMaestro 並非取代 Minecraft 的音樂系統——而是**擴展**它。即使沒有自訂資源包，原版音樂也能變得無縫且具反應性。在此基礎上，官方資源包 [Maestro: Overture](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/maestro-overture) 為主要結構和事件引入了**原創音樂**，進一步豐富遊戲氛圍。\n\n## 完全數據驅動\nMaestro 允許你**僅透過數據添加全新的情境音樂**。透過 JSON 定義曲目應在何時、以何種方式播放——可以透過資源包，或直接使用 [Fragmentum Layer](https://obscurialithium.github.io/fragmentum-layer/) 系統在配置資料夾中設定。[詳細的 Wiki](https://obscurialithium.github.io/maestro/) 提供了清晰的說明文件、範例及進階設定。\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n## 遊戲內配置\n在 Minecraft 1.20.1 中，若使用 [Forge Config Screens](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-screens) 或 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured) 模組，即可使用遊戲內配置選單。若未安裝這些模組，所有設定仍可透過配置檔案（<i>config/obscuria/maestro-client.toml</i>）調整。從 Minecraft 1.21.1 開始，遊戲內配置畫面將原生支援，無需額外依賴項。\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
